From: Logos Maps <maps@logos.co>
Subject: [PATCH] Map: setFeatureState, getFeatureState, removeFeatureState

Expose the renderer's feature state on QMapLibre::Map under the same
locking contract as the queries (P1). Setters request a repaint and
return false until a renderer exists; removals coalesce on the next frame,
as in the core.

Optional (capability-gated): hover/selection without source rewrites, §8.
Requires P1 (shares its renderer forwarding).

Upstream base: maplibre/maplibre-native-qt c3485f3 (docs/architecture.md section 14.1).
